Show me your ID please.
- [Show ID] Here | [if {has_id} == true] [else="disable"]
	Alright, you can go in. No funny business.
	[signal arg="corridor_unlocked"]
- [Show Office Pass] Sorry, I'm here for the interview. | [if {has_pass} == true] [else="disable"]
	Ah, so you're here for an interview. Please head right in.
	[signal arg="corridor_unlocked"]
- [Lie] I'm here to check on the data server
	if {lied_to_mike} == false and CyberattackAdaptationManager.lied_to_mike == false:
		Oh sure, it's right behind the security door at the end of the corridor.
		set {CyberattackAdaptationManager.lied_to_mike} = true
		[signal arg="corridor_unlocked"]
	else:
		I know you. You were here the other day when the computers started acting weird. Sorry but I can't let you in.
- I don't have one
	Sorry, I can't allow unauthorized people inside. Safety protocol.
